# Product essentials — CentrMark templates

Interactive checklists for Software Product Essentials. AsciiDoc printables remain the Antora docs; these `.cmk` files hold **labels and stable ids**. **Progress** lives in a sidecar: `<file>.cmk.checks/state.json5`.

| File | blueprintId | When to attach |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `app-essentials.cmk` | `app-essentials` | Every shippable project |
| `auxiliary-desktop.cmk` | `auxiliary-desktop` | Desktop GUI / tray shells |
| `auxiliary-web.cmk` | `auxiliary-web` | Browser / PWA products |
| `auxiliary-mobile.cmk` | `auxiliary-mobile` | iOS / Android clients |

## Attach

```
nu path/to/general-knowledge/scripts/attach-product-essentials.nu --classes desktop,web
```

Creates `.devcentr/checklists/<id>.cmk` and `<id>.cmk.checks/state.json5`. Do not overwrite progress sidecars casually; `--force` refreshes the `.cmk` only.

## Check off

Update the **sidecar**, not the document markers:

```
checkoff-product-essentials.ps1 -File .devcentr/checklists/auxiliary-desktop.cmk -Id desktop.a.about -Marker x
status-product-essentials.ps1 -File .devcentr/checklists/auxiliary-desktop.cmk
```

Scriptbook `.cmk.runs/` is unrelated (run evidence only).

See how-to + xref checklist-sidecar in general-knowledge docs.
